# Realistic Uncertainty Scenario: Ambiguous Documentation/Arguments in SmartHomeEnv.mode_set

## Uncertainty Manifestation: Ambiguous Temperature Thresholds for Mode Transitions

**Description**:
The `mode_set` function allows setting thermostat modes but lacks clarity on how temperature thresholds work when switching between modes. When changing from one mode to another (especially to/from "auto" mode), developers need to specify temperature thresholds that determine when heating or cooling activates. Without clear documentation on these thresholds, developers make inconsistent assumptions about whether previous thresholds are maintained, reset to defaults, or require explicit setting alongside the mode change.

